{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:54:48+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:54:48+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Ryanair Holdings plc","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Airlines","country":"Ireland","city":"Swords","website":"https://www.ryanair.com","employees":30000,"summary":"Ryanair Holdings plc, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the provision of scheduled-passenger airline services in Ireland, Italy, Spain, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It offers various ancillary services; engages in other activities connected with its air passenger service, including non-flight scheduled and Internet-related services, as well as in-flight sale of beverages, food, duty-free, and merchandise; and markets car hire, travel insurance, and accommodation services through its website and mobile app. The company also provides passenger and aircraft handling, ticketing, and maintenance and repair services; and markets car parking, fast-track, airport transfers, attractions, and activities on its website and mobile app, as well as sells gift vouchers. Ryanair Holdings plc was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Swords, Ireland.","exchange":"Irish","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Ryanair Holdings plc, avec ses filiales, fournit des services aériens à passagers réguliers en Irlande, en Italie, en Espagne, au Royaume-Uni et à l'international. Il offre divers services auxiliaires; se livre à d'autres activités liées à son service de passagers aériens, y compris des services non réguliers et liés à Internet, ainsi que la vente en vol de boissons, de nourriture, de produits en franchise de droits et de marchandises; et commercialise des services de location de voitures, d'assurance voyage et d'hébergement via son site Web et son application mobile. La société fournit également des services de manutention, de billetterie, d'entretien et de réparation de passagers et d'aéronefs; et commercialise des parkings, des services accélérés, des transferts d'aéroport, des attractions et des activités sur son site Web et son application mobile, ainsi que des bons-cadeaux."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":23803783168,"shares_outstanding":1035847831,"trailing_pe":12.910112,"forward_pe":13.997259,"price_to_book":2.5189083,"ev_to_ebitda":6.128,"ev_to_revenue":1.345,"dividend_yield":0.0168,"payout_ratio":0.2355,"beta_yahoo":0.962},"targets":{"current_price":22.98,"mean":28.09737,"median":28.0,"high":31.3,"low":24.0,"n_analysts":19,"reco_mean":1.73684,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-02"],"eps_avg":1.53215,"eps_low":1.34904,"eps_high":1.598,"revenue_avg":5722828170,"ex_dividend":"2026-08-06","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.04226,"institutions_pct":0.5032,"institutions_float_pct":0.5254,"institutions_n":393,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0007,"shares":721133,"value":16571636,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.458}],"funds":[{"name":"Artisan Partners Funds Inc.-Artisan International Value Fund","pct":0.0286,"shares":29644473,"value":681229975,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.060399998},{"name":"Growth Fund of America","pct":0.0147,"shares":15207800,"value":349475237,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.091400005},{"name":"AMERICAN FUNDS INSURANCE SERIES-Eupac Fund","pct":0.0070999996,"shares":7337515,"value":168616091,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":23.1481},{"name":"JANUS INVESTMENT FUND-Janus Henderson Enterprise Fund","pct":0.0044,"shares":4513508,"value":103720411,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"TR PRICE-Price (T.Rowe) International Growth Equity Trust","pct":0.0041,"shares":4242171,"value":97485087,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.121400006},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0037,"shares":3872783,"value":88996551,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0081},{"name":"T. ROWE PRICE Intl Fd.S, INC.-T. Rowe Price Intl Stock